  "entries": [
    {
      "category": "other",
      "scope": null,
      "original": "**Smoother upgrades:** bridge the 2026.11.5 updater to the current release path and validate staged plugin dependencies correctly on Windows. (#200662, #200595) Authored by @steipete. Thanks @RomneyDa and @desksk.",
      "translated": "**PR #188005** 관련 이슈 #187982. @steipete 님 작성. @McgAtom 님께 감사드립니다."
    },
    {
      "category": "other",
      "scope": null,
      "original": "**More resilient conversations:** keep subagent and background turns running through configuration edits, and deliver final answers when a Gateway restart interrupted sending. (#200516, #200553) Thanks @obviyus and @RomneyDa.",
      "translated": "**PR #187564** 관련 이슈 #187519. @steipete 님 작성. @RomneyDa 님께 감사드립니다."
    },
    {
      "category": "other",
      "scope": null,
      "original": "**Lighter, more responsive Gateway:** reduce startup memory pressure and resident memory on constrained hosts, defer unused local credential runtimes, and keep plugin tool discovery from blocking the Gateway. (#191272, #198194, #188033) Authored by @steipete. Thanks @RomneyDa, @vincentkoc, @ctbritt, and @obviyus.",
      "translated": "**PR #200579** @fuller-stack-dev 님께 감사드립니다."
    },
    {
      "category": "other",
      "scope": null,
      "original": "**Reliable long-running model turns:** preserve append-only provider history, exact Responses tool-argument bytes, and final replies from long, tool-heavy Claude CLI turns. (#197874, #200020, #200501) Authored by @steipete. Thanks @RomneyDa, @ZengWen-DT, @obviyus, @boeingchoco, @n1hility, and @Trinity-AI-Coder.",
      "translated": "**PR #200457** 관련 이슈 #200451. @steipete 님 작성. @LolPanda2004 님께 감사드립니다."
    },
    {
      "category": "other",
      "scope": null,
      "original": "**Better conversation continuity:** keep loaded chat history visible during compaction and allow iOS Talk turns to continue beyond the previous 30-second cutoff. (#199534, #163474) Authored by @steipete. Thanks @RomneyDa, @fuller-stack-dev, @vincentkoc, @Olli0103, and @keysersozeh.",
      "translated": "**PR #190024** @yetval 님께 감사드립니다."
    },
    {
      "category": "changed",
      "scope": null,
      "original": "**ChatGPT setup and models:** update Sign in with ChatGPT labels and Business usage guidance, refresh bundled Codex support for newer ChatGPT models, and restore model catalog requests through the inference relay. (#196330, #200784, #197768) Thanks @stevenlee-oai, @hannesrudolph, @VACInc, and @bdjben.",
      "translated": "**PR #193687** @VACInc 님께 감사드립니다."
    },
    {
      "category": "fixed",
      "scope": null,
      "original": "**Git updates:** skip unnecessary declaration builds during ordinary Git updates while preserving explicit build settings and release-build behavior. (#189463) Thanks @vincentkoc.",
      "translated": "**PR #200501** 관련 이슈 #186967. @obviyus 님과 @Trinity-AI-Coder 님께 감사드립니다."
    },
    {
      "category": "fixed",
      "scope": null,
      "original": "**Responses recovery:** recover saved conversation item conflicts before output and across runs without replaying completed effects. (#199757, #199896, #200020) Authored by @steipete.",
      "translated": "**PR #192838** 관련 이슈 #192735. @yousan 님, @obviyus 님, @slatem 님께 감사드립니다."
    },
    {
      "category": "fixed",
      "scope": null,
      "original": "**Subagent results:** retain results through Gateway restarts and resume requester settlement without replaying already-consumed results; keep actual delivery failures distinct from successful consumption. (#199695, #199868, #200249) Authored by @steipete. Thanks @RomneyDa, @vincentkoc, @yousan, @Marvinthebored, @sallyom, and @obviyus.",
      "translated": "**PR #200539** 관련 이슈 #193149. @obviyus 님과 @tommyjoseph 님께"
    },
    {
      "category": "fixed",
      "scope": null,
      "original": "**Large file reads:** stop scanning after the requested text page instead of loading the whole file, while preserving continuation and text-encoding handling. (#186992) Authored by @steipete. Thanks @MoerAI and @JasonBuildAI.",
      "translated": "**Large file reads:** stop scanning after the requested text page instead of loading the whole file, while preserving continuation and text-encoding handling. (#186992) Authored by @steipete. Thanks @MoerAI and @JasonBuildAI."
    },
    {
      "category": "fixed",
      "scope": null,
      "original": "**Credential handling:** redact inline environment credentials in configuration reads and preserve SecretRef-backed skill API keys instead of replacing references with plaintext. (#190618, #200539) Authored by @steipete. Thanks @RomneyDa, @wangmiao0668000666, @yetval, @obviyus, and @tommyjoseph.",
      "translated": "**Credential handling:** redact inline environment credentials in configuration reads and preserve SecretRef-backed skill API keys instead of replacing references with plaintext. (#190618, #200539) Authored by @steipete. Thanks @RomneyDa, @wangmiao0668000666, @yetval, @obviyus, and @tommyjoseph."
    },
    {
      "category": "fixed",
      "scope": null,
      "original": "**Safe configuration writes:** preserve malformed UTF-8 configuration sources before writing and retain rollback snapshots when pre-update writes are interrupted. (#194181, #189946) Authored by @steipete. Thanks @RomneyDa, @syxscott, @zhangguiping-xydt, @fuller-stack-dev, @obviyus, @Alix-007, and @kaguranananana.",
      "translated": "**Safe configuration writes:** preserve malformed UTF-8 configuration sources before writing and retain rollback snapshots when pre-update writes are interrupted. (#194181, #189946) Authored by @steipete. Thanks @RomneyDa, @syxscott, @zhangguiping-xydt, @fuller-stack-dev, @obviyus, @Alix-007, and @kaguranananana."
    },
    {
      "category": "fixed",
      "scope": null,
      "original": "**PostgreSQL upgrades:** stop before replacing a still-serving installation when its PostgreSQL backup cannot run. (#193190) Authored by @steipete. Thanks @etzelm.",
      "translated": "**PostgreSQL upgrades:** stop before replacing a still-serving installation when its PostgreSQL backup cannot run. (#193190) Authored by @steipete. Thanks @etzelm."
    },
    {
      "category": "fixed",
      "scope": null,
      "original": "**Session storage:** keep large rewinds from exhausting the shared database worker and prevent slow history reads from blocking transcript writes. (#198786, #187989) Authored by @steipete. Thanks @RomneyDa, @jalehman, @fuller-stack-dev, and @vincentkoc.",
      "translated": "**Session storage:** keep large rewinds from exhausting the shared database worker and prevent slow history reads from blocking transcript writes. (#198786, #187989) Authored by @steipete. Thanks @RomneyDa, @jalehman, @fuller-stack-dev, and @vincentkoc."
    },
    {
      "category": "fixed",
      "scope": null,
      "original": "**Automation continuity:** keep scheduled automations running when their chat identifier changes. (#200396) Thanks @obviyus.",
      "translated": "**Automation continuity:** keep scheduled automations running when their chat identifier changes. (#200396) Thanks @obviyus."
    },
    {
      "category": "fixed",
      "scope": null,
      "original": "**Channel messages:** preserve Discord user mentions inside code and multiline command arguments in Slack, Feishu, and Zalo. (#200053, #190730) Thanks @RomneyDa, @Sedrak-Hovhannisyan, @obviyus, @saariuslystoned, and @masatohoshino.",
      "translated": "**Channel messages:** preserve Discord user mentions inside code and multiline command arguments in Slack, Feishu, and Zalo. (#200053, #190730) Thanks @RomneyDa, @Sedrak-Hovhannisyan, @obviyus, @saariuslystoned, and @masatohoshino."
    },
    {
      "category": "fixed",
      "scope": null,
      "original": "**Knowledge on Windows:** restore Knowledge writes on Windows. (#189088) Thanks @HermanZeng.",
      "translated": "**Knowledge on Windows:** restore Knowledge writes on Windows. (#189088) Thanks @HermanZeng."
    },
